{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2021-03-01 22:37:00', 'title': 'AWS LAUNCHES SECOND REGION IN JAPAN', 'text': 'SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMAZON WEB SERVICES, INC. (AWS), AN AMAZON.COM COMPANY (NASDAQ:AMZN), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF A SECOND FULL REGION IN JAPAN, THE AWS ASIA PACIFIC (OSAKA) REGION. THE REGION IS AN EXPANSION OF THE EXISTING AWS OSAKA LOCAL REGION, WHICH OPENED TO SELECT CUSTOMERS IN FEBRUARY 2018. THE NEW REGION CONSISTS OF THREE AVAILABILITY ZONES (AZS) AND JOINS THE EXISTING 25 AVAILABILITY ZONES IN EIGHT AWS REGIONS ACROSS ASIA PACIFIC IN BEIJING, HONG KONG, MUMBAI, NINGXIA, SEO'}